  "title": "StoneX Announces a Three-for-Two Stock Split",
  "summary": "NEW YORK, May 26, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- StoneX Group Inc. (NASDAQ: SNEX) announced today that its Board of Directors has approved a three-for-two split of its common stock to make stock ownership more accessible to employees and investors. The stock split will be effected as a stock dividend",
